# crash_refly.scn — crash → auto-DISARM → physical handling → re-calibrate → re-fly
#                    墜落 → 自動DISARM → 物理ハンドリング → 再校正 → 再飛行 (vehicle, Phase 8)
#
# Phase-8 ★robust re-flight capstone. The whole re-fly readiness chain in one run:
#   1. take off, hover in ALTITUDE_HOLD.
#   2. CRASH: one motor degrades (asymmetric torque tips the craft) WHILE a strong
#      downward wind slams it into the ground → the impact failsafe fires (>3 G, ×2) and
#      auto-DISARMs (FLYING → IDLE_GROUND, full ESKF reset, flight mode → STABILIZE).
#   3. the hand PHYSICALLY HANDLES it: lift → right (level the tipped craft) → carry →
#      place back on the ground (Plant kinematic trajectory, ToF rises → IDLE_HELD,
#      placement → IDLE_GROUND → re-calibration starts).
#   4. on the ground it RE-CALIBRATES (gyro/accel bias); ARM is gated until it completes.
#   5. RE-ARM → RE-TAKEOFF → hover recovery in ALTITUDE_HOLD → land/DISARM.
#
# Phase-8 ★ロバスト再飛行キャップストーン。再飛行 readiness の全鎖を1走行で:
#   1. 離陸し ALT_HOLD でホバー。
#   2. 墜落: 1モータ劣化（非対称トルクで機体が傾く）＋強い下向き風で地面に叩きつけ → 衝撃
#      フェイルセーフ作動（>3G×2）で自動DISARM（FLYING→IDLE_GROUND、ESKF全リセット、
#      モード→STABILIZE）。
#   3. 手で物理ハンドリング: 持上げ→正立（傾いた機体を水平へ）→運搬→地面に設置（Plant
#      キネマティック軌道、ToF 上昇→IDLE_HELD、設置→IDLE_GROUND→再校正開始）。
#   4. 地上で再校正（gyro/accel バイアス）。完了まで ARM は判定で拒否。
#   5. 再ARM→再離陸→ALT_HOLD でホバー回復→着陸/DISARM。
#
# Longer than the 25 s default — run with --duration 33000000 (33 s).
# 既定 25s より長い — --duration 33000000（33s）で実行する。
#
# Run: sf sils scenario simulator/sils/scenarios/crash_refly.scn --target vehicle --duration 33000000
#
#
# 2026-10-31 R_out plant — why the hand must arrive early / 手が早く届く必要がある理由:
# the R_out crash leaves the craft lying on its side (truth roll 90 deg). About 0.2 s after impact the firmware
# sees 'placed on ground' and starts the 3.5 s boot calibration; if that completes on its side it measures
# level_offset 1.5708 rad and keeps it in the estimator, so after the hand has levelled the craft the ARM guard
# ('attitude estimate disagrees with gravity', correct behaviour, unchanged) rejects every re-ARM. The handling
# trajectory itself already levels any crash attitude (SLERP to level), so the fix is timing only: the hand now
# starts at 14.0 s (was 16.0 s), inside the calibration window, which restarts the calibration after placement on
# a level craft. The scenario timeline from the re-calibration dwell on is unchanged; the .expect windows of the
# crash-rest and lift checks moved by the same -2.0 s (no threshold changed).
# R_out の墜落では機体が側臥（真値ロール 90 deg）で止まる。衝突の約 0.2 s 後にファームは「設置」と判定して 3.5 s の起動校正を
# 始め、これが側臥のまま完了すると level_offset 1.5708 rad を推定器に保持し、手が水平に直した後も ARM の判定（「姿勢推定が
# 重力と食い違う」、正しい挙動で不変）が再 ARM を全て拒否する。ハンドリング軌道は任意の墜落姿勢を水平へ戻す（SLERP）ので、
# 直すのは時刻だけ: 手は 14.0 s（旧 16.0 s）に始まり校正の最中に届くため、校正は水平な設置後にやり直される。再校正以降の
# 時刻は不変。.expect の墜落静止・持上げ判定の窓は同じ −2.0 s だけ移した（閾値は不変）。
#
#  <t>  ch     <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz> <alt>
   0    rc     2048  2048   2048    2048  0     5000      50              # A: boot disarmed 5 s → IDLE_GROUND + boot calibration
   +    rc     2048  2048   2048    2048  1     1000      50              # B: ARM (rising edge)
   +    rc     3171  2048   2048    2048  1     2500      50              # C: STABILIZE take-off climb 2.5 s (2026-07-26 ODEプラント(実測Ct)対応再調整: 3330->3473, +4.3%, ホバーduty 0.6976->0.7245 移動を打ち消す — stab_flight.scn で実測校正済みの値を流用) | 2026-10-31 R_out plant: STABILIZE/ACRO throttle 3243->3171 (deviation from 2048 x0.94: open-loop hover raw 3154->3088, SILS sweep at 3.87 V) / R_outプラントでホバーraw 3154->3088、偏差x0.94
   +    rc     2048  2048   2048    2048  1     3000      50        1     # D: ALT_HOLD hover 3 s (clean baseline)
#  --- CRASH: asymmetric motor fault (tips the craft) + downward wind slams it down ---
#  --- 墜落: 非対称モータ故障（機体を傾ける）＋下向き風で叩きつけ ---
   +    fault  0     0.30                                                 # E: motor 0 (M1 FR) → 30% — roll/pitch torque tips it
   +    wind   0.0   0.0     2.0                                          # F: 2 N downward shove (NED +z down) — overpowers thrust
   +    rc     2048  2048   2048    2048  1     2000      50        1     # G: armed slam 2 s → impact (>3 G ×2) → auto-DISARM
#  --- Clear the disturbances, settle on the ground (disarmed), then handle ---
#  --- 外乱を解除し地上で静止（disarmed）、その後ハンドリング ---
   +    wind   0.0   0.0     0.0                                          # H: wind off
   +    fault  0     1.00                                                 # I: motor restored (healthy for the re-fly)
   +    rc     2048  2048   2048    2048  0     500       50              # J: disarmed settle 0.5 s (clean falling edge). 2026-10-31 R_out plant: 2500->500 ms, hand arrives while the 3.5 s boot calibration of the side-lying craft is still running (see below) / 2500->500 ms、側臥した機体の起動校正（3.5 s）が終わる前に手が届くようにする
   +    handle 0.40  0.0     0.0     1200  1200  1200                     # K: lift → right → carry to origin → place (3.6 s)
   +    rc     2048  2048   2048    2048  0     10000      50              # L: disarmed 10 s — handle 3.6 s + re-calibration (~3.5 s) + margin | 2026-10-31 R_out plant: 8000->10000 ms (absorbs J's 2.0 s so every later time is unchanged) / 8000->10000 ms（J の 2.0 s を吸収し以降の時刻は不変）
#  --- RE-FLY: re-ARM, re-takeoff, hover recovery ---
#  --- 再飛行: 再ARM・再離陸・ホバー回復 ---
   +    rc     2048  2048   2048    2048  1     1000      50              # M: RE-ARM (rising edge — gated until re-calibration done)
   +    rc     3171  2048   2048    2048  1     2500      50              # N: RE-TAKEOFF climb 2.5 s (2026-07-26 ODEプラント(実測Ct)対応再調整: 3330->3473, +4.3%, 同上) | 2026-10-31 R_out plant: STABILIZE/ACRO throttle 3243->3171 (deviation from 2048 x0.94: open-loop hover raw 3154->3088, SILS sweep at 3.87 V) / R_outプラントでホバーraw 3154->3088、偏差x0.94
   +    rc     2048  2048   2048    2048  1     5000      50        1     # O: ALT_HOLD hover recovery 5 s
   +      rc    2048 2048 2048 2048  0     200       50              # release ARM button / ボタン離し
   +      rc    2048 2048 2048 2048  1     200       50              # press again → DISARM (toggle) / 再押下=DISARM
   +      rc    2048 2048 2048 2048  0     600       50              # settle disarmed / disarm 後整定
